.git
# Only the non-secret CI workflow contract is shipped for the foundation parity check.
# Other .github files remain excluded from the private application image.
.github/*
!.github/workflows/
.github/workflows/*
!.github/workflows/ci.yml
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
frontend/console/node_modules
frontend/console/dist
public_html/assets/operator-console
storage/*
!storage/README.md
!storage/.htaccess
vendor
*.log

# Owner approval verification material is enrolled only in a running private container.
/.private-ops/
